msgstr "Colloids"

#: simcontrols.js:16
msgid ""
"Drag the cellophane paper behind <br> the solutions in the test tubes for "
"checking <br> the transparency of true solution."
msgstr ""
"Drag the cellophane paper behind <br> the solutions in the test tubes for "
"checking <br> the transparency of true solution."

#: simcontrols.js:16
msgid ""
"Click and drag the cellophane paper behind <br> the solutions in the test "
"tubes for checking <br> the transparency of suspension."
msgstr ""
"Click and drag the cellophane paper behind <br> the solutions in the test "
"tubes for checking <br> the transparency of suspension."

#: simcontrols.js:16
msgid ""
"Click and drag the cellophane paper behind <br> the solutions in the test "
"tubes for checking <br> the transparency of colloid."
msgstr ""
"Click and drag the cellophane paper behind <br> the solutions in the test "
"tubes for checking <br> the transparency of colloid."

#: simcontrols.js:17
msgid ""
"Drag the test tube and pour the solution into the <br> test tube through the "
"funnel and glass rod."
msgstr ""
"Drag the test tube and pour the solution into the <br> test tube through the "
"funnel and glass rod."

#: simcontrols.js:17
msgid ""
"Click on the funnel to see the <br> zoomed view of the filter paper content."
msgstr ""
"Click on the funnel to see the <br> zoomed view of the filter paper content."

#: simcontrols.js:18
msgid ""
"Click on on the start button to wait<br>  for 20 minutes for the "
"particles<br> in the solution to settle."
msgstr ""
"Click on on the start button to wait<br>  for 20 minutes for the "
"particles<br> in the solution to settle."

#: simcontrols.js:19
msgid "Drag the test tube to fit it in the stand."
msgstr "Drag the test tube to fit it in the stand."

#: simcontrols.js:19
msgid "Drag the light source to view tyndall effect clearly."
msgstr "Drag the light source to view tyndall effect clearly."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "A true solution is transparent."
msgstr "A true solution is transparent."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "A suspension is opaque."
msgstr "A suspension is opaque."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "A colloid is a translucent."
msgstr "A colloid is a translucent."

#: simcontrols.js:21
msgid ""
"Solid particles cannot be separated from <br>true solution by filtration."
msgstr ""
"Solid particles cannot be separated from <br>true solution by filtration."

#: simcontrols.js:21
msgid "Suspended components of suspension <br> can be separated by filtration."
msgstr ""
"Suspended components of suspension <br> can be separated by filtration."

#: simcontrols.js:21
msgid "Components causing colloid cannot be <br> separated by filtration."
msgstr "Components causing colloid cannot be <br> separated by filtration."

#: simcontrols.js:22
msgid ""
"The true solutions are stable and do not<br> show the depositions of "
"components."
msgstr ""
"The true solutions are stable and do not<br> show the depositions of "
"components."

#: simcontrols.js:22
msgid "Suspension is unstable and show <br>settlement of heavier particles."
msgstr "Suspension is unstable and show <br>settlement of heavier particles."

#: simcontrols.js:22
msgid ""
"Colloids are stable. Their solute particles <br>do not settle down when left "
"undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"Colloids are stable. Their solute particles <br>do not settle down when left "
"undisturbed."

#: simcontrols.js:23
msgid ""
"In true solutions, the solute completely dissolves in the <br>solvent and is "
"present in its molecular size.  Because of <br>this small size,the solute "
"particles do not scatter the <br>light passed through the solution. "
msgstr ""
"In true solutions, the solute completely dissolves in the <br>solvent and is "
"present in its molecular size.  Because of <br>this small size,the solute "
"particles do not scatter the <br>light passed through the solution. "

#: simcontrols.js:23
msgid ""
"The size of the particles in a suspension is of the order <br>of 10<sup>-5</"
"sup> cm or larger.Because of the large size of the <br>particles, "
"suspensions do not show Tyndall effect."
msgstr ""
"The size of the particles in a suspension is of the order <br>of 10<sup>-5</"
"sup> cm or larger.Because of the large size of the <br>particles, "
"suspensions do not show Tyndall effect."

#: simcontrols.js:23
msgid ""
"When a strong beam of light is passed through a colloidal solution <br>the "
"light is scattered by the particles of the colloid. Thus the <br>path of "
"light is clearly visible in the colloid."
msgstr ""
"When a strong beam of light is passed through a colloidal solution <br>the "
"light is scattered by the particles of the colloid. Thus the <br>path of "
"light is clearly visible in the colloid."

